Appendix G: Monte Carlo Uncertainty Protocol – Planned Distributions

This appendix specifies the probability distributions that would be used in a future Monte Carlo simulation. No draws have been generated.

G.1 Number of Draws

10,000 independent iterations.

G.2 Distribution Assumptions

Parameter Distribution Parameters Rationale
Survival S_i(t) Beta‑PERT per life‑table year Min, mode, max from HMD CIs Bounded, flexible
